/td>\r\t\t\t<td>3374</td>\r\t\t\t<td>−328</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\r\t\t\t<td>1008</td>\r\t\t\t<td>1846</td>\r\t\t\t<td>−295</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t\t<tr>\r\t\t\t<td>V</td>\r\t\t\t<td>2372</td>\r\t\t\t<td>5251</td>\r\t\t\t<td>+48</td>\r\t\t</tr>\r\t</tbody>\r</table>\r<br />\rthe least reactive non- metal and the most reactive metal of these are respectively",
